      "content": "For a headache and fever, you should be very cautious about your dosage, especially with a history of liver concerns. I strongly advise you to strictly adhere to the recommended maximum dose on the packaging, which is usually 1000mg every 4-6 hours, and never exceed the daily limit. Because of your liver history, you should really check with your doctor or pharmacist first to ensure Tylenol is safe for you right now.",
